@flexiarg aif/interoceptive-tripwires
@title Interoceptive Tripwires (Freeze, Record, Park, Summon)
@keywords tripwire, interoception, invariant, phase boundary, retro-trip, blind-spot map, stop-line, wedge, livelock, precision evidence
@audience anyone running a control loop live whose failures have so far been found by post-hoc archaeology
@tone technical
@style pattern
@provenance written 2026-08-30 (claude-15) from the catalogue paragraph numbered R20 in p4ng/sec-catalog.tex (PLoP 2026), so that every R-node on Figure 4 has a library pattern; wording follows the paragraph, which is the standard. The implementation on record (futon2/src/futon2/aif/tripwire.clj, 13 wires, 2026-07-16) watches the coding-cohort runner, not the AIF loop — see futon4/holes/delivery-lifecycle.v1.md §0
@see-also aif/no-self-certification aif/evidence-precision-registry
@holds-at R20   ;; pegged 2026-08-30 (claude-15): the catalogue paragraph numbered R20; see PREREG-war-machine §1b

! conclusion: Weave a supplementary harness of invariant tripwires around the live run at its phase boundaries — each wire a near-infinite-precision prior over machine trajectories — so that a violation is noticed at the moment it happens, with the state still warm; a trip is surprisal that belief updating cannot explain away, and the mandated action is freeze, record, park, summon, on a ladder that degrades only toward recording.

  + context: A loop whose constructed core (R1–R16) has been hardened and which now runs live,
    where every pathology so far — wedges, livelocks, mixed code images, silently lost wakes — was
    discovered afterwards, on a completed broken run.

  + IF:
      You have hardened the loop's constructed core and want the machinery itself to be observable
      while it runs live.

  + HOWEVER:
      The loop's observation channel is task-level only: it observes the world it acts on (job
      outcomes, verdicts, witnesses, QA), while its own machinery is a hidden state with no
      likelihood mapping. And simulation tests of the known invariants pass by construction the
      moment the known bugs are fixed, so neither channel can notice the failure modes nobody has
      imagined yet.

  + THEN:
      Weave a supplementary harness of invariant tripwires around the live run at its phase
      boundaries. Each wire is a near-infinite-precision prior over machine trajectories — turn
      conservation, ledger closure, review-commit provenance binding, append-only repair stores and
      their status lattice, wedge and livelock detectors, wall-clock overrides, loaded-code/file-code
      coherence, and an environment-alphabet wire on which any unknown job state trips rather than
      defaulting. A trip is surprisal that belief updating cannot explain away, and the mandated
      epistemic action is freeze, record, park, summon: write the frozen state as a durable report,
      open a typed stop-line through the loop's own repair machinery, park an investigation join and
      summon the outer reviewer, on a fail-safe ladder that only ever degrades toward recording,
      never toward blocking the run. Calibrate before arming: the wires must retro-trip on the known
      incident corpus (a wire that does not fire on the known past is a dud laser), and every closed
      incident thereafter must deposit either a new wire or an entry on an explicit blind-spot map.

  + BECAUSE:
      This is interoception, not vision. Like any sensorium it admits no completeness theorem — it
      gets identifiability checks, a measured coverage number, and a blind-spot map instead. An
      organism with only a hand (R16) and a preference model (C) learns of poison from the stomach
      ache, and each hotfix repairs one meal; an organism with interoceptive nerves notices at the
      moment of violation and every incident leaves it permanently more observant. The trip stream
      is also precision evidence about the machine itself (R7): a wire whose trips keep being
      blessed as model revisions demotes itself, and a genuine trip should lower the system's
      confidence in its own machinery until the finding is discharged.
      + evidence: the operational witness of 2026-07-16: eleven wires specified from the loop's own
        fix-ledgers, retro-tripping 4/4 on the reconstructed incident corpus; first live catch about
        itself (fifteen shadow-mode trips from a baseline captured mid-load); 43 trips 07-16..07-27,
        all but one :record.
      + COUNTERFACTUAL: a blind-spot map with one entry that does not name the loop the harness was
        built for is the failure this pattern must refuse — recorded against the July harness, which
        watched the coding runner while the AIF loop it was meant to observe had already gone
        quiet (futon4/holes/delivery-lifecycle.v1.md §0).
